return {
["15:00"]={"Dating from \003three o’clock\004 yesterday. My perpetual influence could not begin earlier, or you would not have been so much out of humour before.","Emma","Jane Austen"},
["15:01"]={"It was \003one minute past three\004. As he walked, he became aware of the echoing sound his feet made on the marble floor. It was then that he heard a voice say, “Do you wish to confess, my son?”","Sons of Fortune","Jeffrey Archer"},
["15:02"]={"But after months of checking and rechecking, Joseph Ricardo, of mixed race, born illegitimately in a Buenos Aires hospital at \003two minutes past three\004 Western time on 19 October 1995, had officially been recognized.","The Children of Men","P.D. James"},
["15:03"]={"I check Shingi’s mobile phone — it says it’s \0033:03 pm\004. I get out of bed, open my suitcase to take clean socks out and the smell of Mother hit my nose and make me feel dizzy.","Harare North","Brian Chikwava"},
["15:04"]={"He saw the clock in the town-hall tower standing at \003four minutes past three\004 on that hot and windless late-July afternoon.","The Tommyknockers","Stephen King"},
["15:05"]={"For one moment Ruth could see the bones of the bats standing out clearly, as if in an X-ray picture.\nThen all the green turned black.\nIt was \0033:05 P.M.\004","The Tommyknockers","Stephen King"},
["15:06"]={"The clock on the “Lal Girja’s” tower stood at \003six minutes past three\004.","Breakfast in the Ruins","Michael Moorcock"},
["15:07"]={"The next day was grey, threatening rain. He was there at \003seven minutes past three\004. The clock on the church over the way pointed to it. They had arranged to be there at three fifteen. Therefore, if she had been there when he came, she would have been eight minutes before her time.","Twenty Thousand Streets Under The Sky","Patrick Hamilton"},
["15:09"]={"On the next day he boarded the London train which reaches Hull at \0033:09\004. At Paragon Station he soon singled out Beamish from Merriman’s description.","The Pit-Prop Syndicate","Freeman Wills Crofts"},
["15:10"]={"This time it was only the simple fact that the hands chanced to point to \0033:10 pm\004, the precise moment at which all the clocks of London had stopped.","The Purple Cloud","M.P. Shiel"},
["15:11"]={"When Virginia entered the tea room at \003eleven minutes past three\004, Giles gasped. No one would have thought it possible that this elegant woman was over sixty.","This Was a Man","Jeffrey Archer"},
["15:12"]={"At \003twelve minutes past three\004, an announcement came over the loudspeaker. “All those involved in the Cartwright case, please make their way back in to court number four, as the jury is returning.”","A Prisoner of Birth","Jeffrey Archer"},
["15:13"]={"The lift moved. It was \003thirteen minutes past three\004. The bell gave out its ping. Two men stepped out of the lift, Alan Norman and another man. Tony Blair walked into the office.","Virtual Assassin","Simon Kearns"},
["15:14"]={"I shall be back at exactly \003THREE fourteen\004, for our hour of revery together, real sweet revery darling","On the Road","Jack Kerouac"},
["15:15"]={"A \003quarter after three\004. There was time to check with the local morgues to see if they had turned up any likely John Does — who knew, my search might be over before the day’s end — and then get bank to deposit my money and fire off a check to my landlord.","Storm Front","Jim Butcher"},
